# CS663: DIP Assignment 3

## Instructions

Run "zip -s0 part.zip --out submission.zip" and "unzip submission.zip" on terminal to extract the codes and outputs.
Keep folders q1, q2, q3, q4 and data in the same directory for the codes to run.

## Q1

**Performance:** Numba is used in the optimized implementations to accelerate the computationally intensive distance calculations. The corresponding versions without Numba are included as baseline implementations; they are slower but avoid the Numba dependency.

## Q3

**Performance:** Numba is used in the optimized implementations to accelerate the computationally intensive distance calculations. The corresponding versions without Numba are included as baseline implementations; they are slower but avoid the Numba dependency.

## Q4

**Final configuration:** The search selected \(K=25\), face-space threshold `5339.416504`, and identity threshold `1646.676794`, achieving 92.50% accuracy (148/160 test images). Values also reported by printing to terminal.

